$ (cd arc1_v1w1 && breakpoint_candidates.py)
Candidate breakpoint curves: for each fixed root r_k (k != idx0),
the tangency condition <r_k, u1(theta,t)> = 1, i.e.
  cos(theta)*a_k + sin(theta)*(cos(t)*b_k + sin(t)*c_k) = 1
where a_k=<r_k,u0>, b_k=<r_k,v1>, c_k=<r_k,w1>.

(a_k, b_k, c_k)      #roots   example labels
